  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chocolate Pie.png|alt=|left|200x200px|Chocolate pie]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 65\n |price = 1 to 514\n |time = 1 h 15 min\n |xp = 70\n |source = {{Infoicon|PieO|bigger|link=Pie Oven}}\n |base = 143\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 1 hr 3 min\n}}\n'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 65.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making chocolate pie'''===\n[[File:Pie Oven.png|150px|left|link=Pie Oven|Pie Oven]]\nChocolate pie is made in the [[Pie Oven]].\n\nTo make a chocolate pie, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|link=Wheat]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|link=Egg]]\n|[[File:Peanuts.png|75px|link=Peanuts]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour 15 minutes to make one chocolate pie, and 1 hour and 3 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] oven. Each pie gives players 70 {{Infoicon|xp}} points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling chocolate pies'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|link=Roadside Shop|Roadside Shop]]\n\n*Chocolate pies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,148 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 pies.\n*Buying the ingredients required to make a pie costs 433 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|link=Boat|Riverboat]]\n\n*[[Boat]] orders require 2 chocolate pies per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Schokoladenkuchen\n|es = Tarta de chocolate\n|fr = Tarte au Chocolat\n|it = Crostata al cioccolato\n|nl = Chocoladetaart\n|no = Sjokoladepai\n|zh = Chocolate Pie\n}}\n[[pt-br:Torta de chocolate]]\n[[ru:Шоколадный пирог]]\n\n[[Category:Pie Oven Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]\n[[Category:Peanuts Products]]",
